{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to dozens of unique star systems and slay all enemies to continue your journey across the galaxy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena layout changes after the first wave, adapt quickly and don't lose track of your surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of weapons and special abilities and\u00a0rise to the challenge of mastering your kill efficiency\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install chips to gain powerful traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the full potential of your weapons by discovering powerful synergies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise the appearance of your space drone to match your style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/b320e1889cc19b27832ad3869f4144a3.poster.avif?t=1770041181\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/b320e1889cc19b27832ad3869f4144a3.webm?t=1770041181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/b320e1889cc19b27832ad3869f4144a3.mp4?t=1770041181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cheats to fine-tune the difficulty and tailor the challenge to your liking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful Cheats:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbounded energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal after every defeated enemy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging</strong> <strong>Cheats:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drone becomes invisible to your own eyes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies deal double damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus Mode: double upgrade efficiency, but double the chance of receiving a virus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/616b79c1770fd63424c50323b11240a2.poster.avif?t=1770041181\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/616b79c1770fd63424c50323b11240a2.webm?t=1770041181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/616b79c1770fd63424c50323b11240a2.mp4?t=1770041181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Points</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP to unlock colours, patterns, cheats, and drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 6 playable drones, each with different starting conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/07ab4d0b2707abdfb4c4a25c8c5b5f83.poster.avif?t=1770041181\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/07ab4d0b2707abdfb4c4a25c8c5b5f83.webm?t=1770041181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/extras/07ab4d0b2707abdfb4c4a25c8c5b5f83.mp4?t=1770041181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war began when our galaxy was invaded by an army of insectoid creatures known as the Minaripods. They are an aggressive species driven purely by instinct to eliminate all other life forms. In these dark times, space travel has become nearly impossible, as they generate an unknown dark substance that reduces visibility throughout the galaxy. Minaripods reproduce rapidly, so you have to exterminate them in one go. Fortunately, you have unlimited attempts for this mission. You control your drone safely from afar, far away from the battlefield. Embark on an epic journey to illuminate the darkness!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arrival at HQ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/73a0ea3730f67476a4a3c9893a6f9085d966bdd5.jpg"},{"name":"First Zone Illuminated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/b14bbe2400b0ad32784b666cd444d0b7df54ea03.jpg"},{"name":"Second Zone Illuminated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/e0225c345b646daf28916551c13c9ca34582621f.jpg"},{"name":"Always Give 200%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/4da2df602e1e54a7da36f77718b8d002c2b25ea0.jpg"},{"name":"Third Zone Illuminated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/bcef2890e9bcf12d321358aca70938c6d10c3fa8.jpg"},{"name":"Fourth Zone Illuminated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/0297a09da885a8ff41f3e0cc1a2eb997ed8f91eb.jpg"},{"name":"Violet Drone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/fe1e148d2a9846dd30a8c0f3800f0bbe58d91b71.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Drone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2532830/7e2fa17fcd00e499f