e darkness!</p>","developers":["Dominik Drozdz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532830/366a8fb9f1a35e1fc052b507d7460cffcdbd5713/header.jpg?t=1770041181","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Mint 21.3 (Kernel 6.8) or similar<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Mint 21.3 (Kernel 6.8) or similar<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2532830/1809966455/0efbb7bc23eb8bf53e9449d873ac018530fe12d5/1769620284/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769625593","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2532830/1809966455/0efbb7bc23eb8bf53e9449d873ac018530fe12d5/1769620284/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769625593","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2532830/1809966455/0efbb7bc23eb8bf53e9449d873ac018530fe12d5/1769620284/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769625593","id":257274764,"name":"DarkGalaxyTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257274764/e755d4c83933d7e8a907e95fb2f19e9840e05e57/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769625593"}],"name":"Dark Galaxy","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selec